\n1 15 80 0 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 80 -24 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 80 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 80 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n\n1 15 60 0 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 60 -24 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 60 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 15 60 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n0 STEP\n\n0 STEP 03: BILLBOARD TOP BEAM AND CATWALK\n0 NOTE Horizontal beam and narrow catwalk where the monkey balances\n1 72 70 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 72 50 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 72 80 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n\n1 7 70 -24 -60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 7 50 -24 -60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 7 60 -24 -60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n0 STEP\n\n0 STEP 04: ORIGINAL JUNGLE-SODA AD PANEL\n0 NOTE Bright colorful pixels representing the original billboard art\n1 4 60 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 14 70 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 2 80 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n\n1 14 60 -56 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 4 70 -56 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 2 80 -56 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n0 STEP\n\n0 STEP 05: MONKEY MINIFIGURE (RIFF) ON CATWALK\n0 NOTE Brick-built monkey: legs, hips, torso, head, and arms as separate pieces\n0 NOTE Position: mid-rooftop facing billboard, slightly below panel\n1 18 40 0 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 18 40 -24 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 18 40 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 19 40 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 18 20 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n1 18 60 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3005.dat\n0 STEP\n\n0 STEP 06: PARAKEET (PIXEL) PERCHED ON BILLBOARD\n0 NOTE Small bright bird sitting on the top beam, acting as lookout\n1 14 70 -88 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n1 2 70 -96 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/3024.dat\n0 STEP\n\n0 STEP 07: PAI